#: src/qml/pages/PowerfulWhenNeeded.qml:124
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Learn about more Plasma features"
msgstr "Saznaj više o mogućnostima Plasme"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/Activities.qml:22
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:window"
msgid "Activities"
msgstr "Aktivnosti"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/Activities.qml:23
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"Activities can be used to separate high-level projects or workflows so you "
"can focus on one at a time. You can have an activity for “Home”, “School”, "
"“Work”, and so on. Each Activity has access to all your files but has its "
"own set of open apps and windows, recent documents, “Favorite” apps, and "
"desktop widgets."
msgstr ""
"Aktivnosti služe za razdvajanje krupnih projekata ili tokova rada, tako da "
"se možete usredsrediti na jedan po jedan. Možete imati aktivnosti „Kuća“, "
"„Škola“, „Posao“ i tako dalje. Svaka aktivnost ima pristup svim vašim "
"fajlovima, ali ima svoj skup otvorenih programa i prozora, nedavnih "
"dokumenata, „omiljenih“ programa i vidžeta na površi."

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/Activities.qml:28
#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/KRunner.qml:29
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Open Settings…"
msgstr "Otvori postavke…"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/Activities.qml:56
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"To get started, launch <interface>System Settings</interface> and search for "
"“Activities”. On that page, you can create more Activities. You can then "
"switch between them using the <shortcut>%1</shortcut> keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"Za početak pokrenite <interface>Sistemske postavke</interface> i potražite "
"„Aktivnosti“. Na toj stranici možete napraviti još aktivnosti. Zatim se "
"između njih možete prebacivati prečicom <shortcut>%1</shortcut>."

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/KDEConnect.qml:17
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:window"
msgid "KDE Connect"
msgstr "KDE‑konekcija"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/KDEConnect.qml:21
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"KDE Connect lets you integrate your phone with your computer in various ways:"
"<nl/><list><item>See notifications from your phone on your computer</"
"item><item>Reply to text messages from your phone on your computer</"
"item><item>Sync your clipboard contents between your computer and your "
"phone</item><item>Make a noise on your phone when it’s been misplaced</"
"item><item>Copy pictures, videos, and other files from your phone to your "
"computer, and vice versa</item><item>…And much more!</item></list>"
msgstr ""
"KDE‑konekcija vam omogućava da na razne načine povežete telefon sa računarom:"
"<nl/><list><item>Gledajte obaveštenja sa telefona na računaru</"
"item><item>Odgovarajte na tekstualne poruke sa telefona na računaru</"
"item><item>Usklađujte sadržaj klipborda između računara i telefona</"
"item><item>Pustite zvuk na telefonu kad ga zagubite</item><item>Kopirajte "
"slike, video snimke i druge fajlove sa telefona na računar i obrnuto</"
"item><item>…I još mnogo toga!</item></list>"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/KDEConnect.qml:35
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"To get started, click the <interface>%1</interface> button. You can pair "
"your phone there."
msgstr ""
"Za početak kliknite na dugme <interface>%1</interface>. Tamo možete upariti "
"telefon."

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/KDEConnect.qml:50
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Open %1"
msgstr "Otvori program %1"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/KDEConnect.qml:62
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "KDE Connect is not installed."
msgstr "KDE‑konekcija nije instalirana."

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/KDEConnect.qml:67
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button Install KDE Connect"
msgid "Install KDE Connect…"
msgstr "Instaliraj KDE‑konekciju…"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/KRunner.qml:22
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:window"
msgid "KRunner"
msgstr "K‑izvođač"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/KRunner.qml:23
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"KRunner is Plasma’s exceptionally powerful and versatile search system. It "
"powers the search functionality in the Application Launcher menu and the "
"Overview screen, and it can be accessed as a standalone search bar using the "
"<shortcut>%1</shortcut> keyboard shortcut.<nl/><nl/>In addition to finding "
"your files and folders, KRunner can launch apps, search the web, convert "
"between currencies, calculate math problems, and a lot more."
msgstr ""
"K‑izvođač je izuzetno moćan i svestran sistem pretrage u Plasmi. Pokreće "
"pretragu u meniju pokretača programa i na ekranu pregleda, a može se pozvati "
"i kao samostalna traka za pretragu, prečicom <shortcut>%1</shortcut>.<nl/"
"><nl/>Osim što nalazi vaše fajlove i fascikle, K‑izvođač može da pokreće "
"programe, pretražuje veb, pretvara valute, rešava matematičke zadatke i još "
"mnogo toga."

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/KRunner.qml:58
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"To learn more, open the KRunner search bar using the <shortcut>%1</shortcut> "
"keyboard shortcut and click on the question mark icon."
msgstr ""
"Da biste saznali više, otvorite traku za pretragu K‑izvođača prečicom "
"<shortcut>%1</shortcut> i kliknite na ikonicu sa znakom pitanja."

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/KRunner.qml:71
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@info:usagetip An example KRunner query, ensure keywords are localized as "
"they are in the actual runner plugins. If needed, change 'Shanghai' to a "
"city that on the other side of the world from likely speakers of the "
"language."
msgid "time Shanghai"
msgstr "vreme Šangaj"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/KRunner.qml:73
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@info:usagetip An example KRunner query, ensure keywords are localized as "
"they are in the actual runner plugins."
msgid "27 / 3"
msgstr "27 / 3"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/KRunner.qml:75
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@info:usagetip An example KRunner query, ensure keywords are localized as "
"they are in the actual runner plugins. If needed, change the currency "
"conversion to a likely one for speakers of the language."
msgid "200 EUR in USD"
msgstr "200 EUR u USD"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/KRunner.qml:77
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@info:usagetip An example KRunner query, ensure keywords are localized as "
"they are in the actual runner plugins. If needed, change the conversion to a "
"likely one for speakers of the language."
msgid "25 miles in km"
msgstr "25 milja u km"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/KRunner.qml:79
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@info:usagetip An addendum to example KRunner queries, intentionally using "
"'...' as these are the characters a person would type for ellipses"
msgid "...and much more!"
msgstr "...i još mnogo toga!"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/MetaKey.qml:18
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:window"
msgid "Keyboard Shortcuts"
msgstr "Prečice sa tastature"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/MetaKey.qml:23
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Configure Shortcuts…"
msgstr "Podesi prečice…"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/MetaKey.qml:29
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"Almost anything in Plasma can be done with the keyboard, using shortcuts "
"that mostly involve the <shortcut>Meta</shortcut> key.<nl/><nl/>On a Mac "
"keyboard, this is the “Command” key:"
msgstr ""
"Skoro sve u Plasmi može se uraditi tastaturom, prečicama koje uglavnom "
"uključuju taster <shortcut>Meta</shortcut>.<nl/><nl/>Na tastaturi Applea to "
"je taster „Command“:"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/MetaKey.qml:30
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"Almost anything in Plasma can be done with the keyboard, using shortcuts "
"that mostly involve the <shortcut>Meta</shortcut> key.<nl/><nl/>This key is "
"usually located between the left <shortcut>Ctrl</shortcut> and "
"<shortcut>Alt</shortcut> keys, and contains either a symbol of some kind, or "
"the word “Super”:"
msgstr ""
"Skoro sve u Plasmi može se uraditi tastaturom, prečicama koje uglavnom "
"uključuju taster <shortcut>Meta</shortcut>.<nl/><nl/>Ovaj taster se obično "
"nalazi između levih tastera <shortcut>Ctrl</shortcut> i <shortcut>Alt</"
"shortcut>, a na njemu je neki simbol ili reč „Super“:"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/MetaKey.qml:56
#, kde-format
msgctxt "The typical label for the keyboard's Ctrl key"
msgid "Ctrl"
msgstr "Ctrl"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/MetaKey.qml:59
#, kde-format
msgctxt "The typical label for the keyboard's Function key"
msgid "Fn"
msgstr "Fn"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/MetaKey.qml:82
#, kde-format
msgctxt "The typical label for the keyboard's Meta key"
msgid "Super"
msgstr "Super"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/MetaKey.qml:90
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"This is a terrible dad joke about the meta key on the keyboard being able to "
"have many symbols. Translate it into one of similar groanworthiness if this "
"is possible; if not, translate it as an single space."
msgid "I never meta key I didn't like"
msgstr "Ko god da je na tasteru, meta je ista"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/MetaKey.qml:128
#, kde-format
msgctxt "The typical label for the keyboard's Alt key"
msgid "Alt"
msgstr "Alt"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/MetaKey.qml:141
#, kde-format
msgctxt "The actual translated label for 'fn' on a Mac keyboard"
msgid "fn"
msgstr "fn"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/MetaKey.qml:146
#, kde-format
msgctxt "The actual translated label for 'control' on a Mac keyboard"
msgid "control"
msgstr "control"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/MetaKey.qml:150
#, kde-format
msgctxt "The actual translated label for 'option' on a Mac keyboard"
msgid "option"
msgstr "option"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/MetaKey.qml:155
#, kde-format
msgctxt "The actual translated label for 'command' on a Mac keyboard"
msgid "command"
msgstr "command"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/MetaKey.qml:164
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"What can you do with the <shortcut>Meta</shortcut> key? Here are a few "
"examples:<list><item>Press it: Open the Application Launcher widget</"
"item><item>Press <shortcut>Meta+[arrow keys]</shortcut>: Tile window to "
"screen edges or corners</item><item>Press <shortcut>Meta+[number keys]</"
"shortcut>: Launch pinned Task Manager apps</item><item>Press <shortcut>Meta"
"+R</shortcut>: Start a screen recording</item><item>Press <shortcut>Meta+L</"
"shortcut>: Lock the screen</item><item>Press <shortcut>Meta+Shift+S</"
"shortcut>: Toggle screen reader on/off</item><item>Press <shortcut>Meta+Alt"
"+P</shortcut>: Move keyboard focus to panel</item><item>Press <shortcut>Meta"
"+Esc</shortcut>: Launch System Monitor app</item><item>Press <shortcut>Meta+."
"</shortcut>: Launch Emoji Selector app</item><item>Press <shortcut>Meta+D</"
"shortcut>: Show the desktop</item></list>"
msgstr ""
"Šta možete da uradite tasterom <shortcut>Meta</shortcut>? Evo nekoliko "
"primera:<list><item>Pritisnite ga: otvaranje vidžeta „Pokretač programa“</"
"item><item>Pritisnite <shortcut>Meta+[tasteri strelica]</shortcut>: "
"popločavanje prozora uz ivice ili uglove ekrana</item><item>Pritisnite "
"<shortcut>Meta+[brojčani tasteri]</shortcut>: pokretanje programa zakačenih "
"u menadžeru zadataka</item><item>Pritisnite <shortcut>Meta+R</shortcut>: "
"početak snimanja ekrana</item><item>Pritisnite <shortcut>Meta+L</shortcut>: "
"zaključavanje ekrana</item><item>Pritisnite <shortcut>Meta+Shift+S</"
"shortcut>: uključivanje i isključivanje čitača ekrana</item><item>Pritisnite "
"<shortcut>Meta+Alt+P</shortcut>: pomeranje fokusa tastature na panel</"
"item><item>Pritisnite <shortcut>Meta+Esc</shortcut>: pokretanje programa "
"„Nadzornik sistema“</item><item>Pritisnite <shortcut>Meta+.</shortcut>: "
"pokretanje programa „Birač emodžija“</item><item>Pritisnite <shortcut>Meta"
"+D</shortcut>: prikaz površi</item></list>"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/Overview.qml:19
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:window The name of a KWin effect"
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Pregled"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/Overview.qml:20
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"Overview is a full-screen overlay that shows all of your open windows, "
"letting you easily access any of them. It also shows your current Virtual "
"Desktops, allowing you to add more, remove some, and switch between them. "
"Finally, it offers a KRunner-powered search field that can also filter "
"through open windows."
msgstr ""
"Pregled je sloj preko celog ekrana koji prikazuje sve vaše otvorene prozore "
"i omogućava lak pristup svakom od njih. Prikazuje i trenutne virtuelne "
"površi, pa možete dodavati nove, uklanjati neke i prebacivati se između "
"njih. Najzad, nudi polje za pretragu koje pokreće K‑izvođač, a koje može da "
"filtrira i otvorene prozore."

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/Overview.qml:44
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"You can access Overview using the <shortcut>%1</shortcut> keyboard shortcut, "
"or by moving your mouse into the top-left corner of the screen. You can also "
"press <shortcut>%2</shortcut> for Grid View, which shows Virtual Desktops in "
"a grid."
msgstr ""
"Pregledu možete pristupiti prečicom <shortcut>%1</shortcut> ili pomeranjem "
"miša u gornji levi ugao ekrana. Možete pritisnuti i <shortcut>%2</shortcut> "
"za mrežni prikaz, koji prikazuje virtuelne površi u mreži."

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/Vaults.qml:22
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:window"
msgid "Plasma Vaults"
msgstr "Plasma trezori"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/Vaults.qml:23
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"Plasma Vaults allows you to create encrypted folders, called "
"<interface>Vaults.</interface> Inside each Vault, you can securely store "
"your passwords, files, pictures, and documents, safe from prying eyes. "
"Vaults can live inside folders that are synced to cloud storage services "
"too, providing extra privacy for that content."
msgstr ""
"Plasma trezori vam omogućavaju da napravite šifrovane fascikle, koje se zovu "
"<interface>trezori.</interface> U svakom trezoru možete bezbedno čuvati "
"lozinke, fajlove, slike i dokumente, daleko od radoznalih očiju. Trezori "
"mogu biti i u fasciklama koje se usklađuju sa servisima za skladištenje u "
"oblaku, što pruža dodatnu privatnost za taj sadržaj."

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/Vaults.qml:97
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window Title of the Plasma Vaults popup"
msgid "Vaults"
msgstr "Trezori"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/Vaults.qml:112
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title The name of an example Plasma vault"
msgid "Important Documents"
msgstr "Važni dokumenti"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/Vaults.qml:113
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title The name of an example Plasma vault"
msgid "My Photos"
msgstr "Moje fotografije"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/Vaults.qml:121
#, kde-format
msgid "Unlock and Open"
msgstr "Otključaj i otvori"

#: src/qml/pages/powerfulwhenneeded/Vaults.qml:133
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"To get started, click the arrow on the <interface>System Tray</interface> to "
"show hidden items, and then click the <interface>Vaults</interface> icon."
msgstr ""
"Za početak kliknite na strelicu u <interface>sistemskoj kaseti</interface> "
"da prikažete skrivene stavke, a zatim kliknite na ikonicu "
"<interface>Trezori</interface>."

#: src/qml/pages/SimpleByDefault.qml:21
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:window"
msgid "Simple by Default"
msgstr "Podrazumevano jednostavna"

#: src/qml/pages/SimpleByDefault.qml:22
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"Plasma is designed to be simple and usable out of the box. Things are where "
"you would expect, and there is generally no need to configure anything "
"before you can be comfortable and productive.<nl/><nl/>Below is a visual "
"representation of a typical Plasma Desktop; move the pointer over or click "
"on something to learn about it!"
msgstr ""
"Plasma je osmišljena da bude jednostavna i upotrebljiva odmah po "
"instaliranju. Stvari su tamo gde ih očekujete i uglavnom nema potrebe da "
"išta podešavate da biste se osećali prijatno i bili produktivni.<nl/><nl/"
">Ispod je vizuelni prikaz tipične površi Plasme; pređite pokazivačem preko "
"nečega ili kliknite na to da biste saznali šta je!"

#: src/qml/pages/SimpleByDefault.qml:33
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This is the “Desktop”. It shows files and folders that are contained in your "
"<filename>Desktop</filename> folder, and can hold widgets. Right-click on it "
"and choose <interface>Desktop and Wallpaper…</interface> to configure the "
"appearance of the desktop. You can also choose <interface>Enter Edit Mode</"
"interface> to add, remove or modify widgets."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je „površ“. Prikazuje fajlove i fascikle koje se nalaze u vašoj fascikli "
"<filename>Desktop</filename> i može da sadrži vidžete. Kliknite desnim "
"dugmetom na nju i izaberite <interface>Površ i tapet…</interface> da "
"podesite izgled površi. Možete izabrati i <interface>Uđi u režim uređivanja</"
"interface> da dodate, uklonite ili izmenite vidžete."

#: src/qml/pages/SimpleByDefault.qml:36
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This is a “Panel” — a container to hold widgets. Right-click on it and "
"choose <interface>Show Panel Configuration</interface> to change how it "
"behaves, which screen edge it lives on, and to add, remove or modify widgets."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je „panel“ — sadržalac za vidžete. Kliknite desnim dugmetom na njega i "
"izaberite <interface>Prikaži postavu panela</interface> da promenite kako se "
"ponaša, uz koju ivicu ekrana stoji, i da dodate, uklonite ili izmenite "
"vidžete."

#: src/qml/pages/SimpleByDefault.qml:39
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This is the “Application Launcher” widget, a multipurpose launcher. Here you "
"can launch apps, shut down or restart the system, access recent files, and "
"more. Click on it to get started!"
msgstr ""
"Ovo je vidžet „Pokretač programa“, višenamenski pokretač. Ovde možete "
"pokretati programe, ugasiti ili ponovo pokrenuti sistem, pristupiti nedavnim "
"fajlovima i još mnogo toga. Kliknite na njega da počnete!"

#: src/qml/pages/SimpleByDefault.qml:42
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This is the “Task Manager” widget, where you can switch between open apps "
"and also launch new ones. Drag app icons to re-arrange them."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je vidžet „Menadžer zadataka“, u kom možete prelaziti između otvorenih "
"programa i pokretati nove. Prevucite ikonice programa da ih preuredite."

#: src/qml/pages/SimpleByDefault.qml:45
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This is the “System Tray” widget, which lets you control system functions "
"like changing the volume and connecting to networks. Items will become "
"visible here only when relevant. To see all available items, click the ⌃ "
"arrow next to the clock."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je vidžet „Sistemska kaseta“, pomoću kog možete upravljati sistemom, na "
"primer menjati jačinu zvuka i povezivati se na mreže. Stavke će se ovde "
"pojaviti samo kad su bitne. Da biste videli sve dostupne stavke, kliknite na "
"strelicu ⌃ pored sata."

#: src/qml/pages/SimpleByDefault.qml:48
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This is the “Digital Clock” widget. Click on it to show a calendar. It can "
"be also configured to show other timezones and events from your digital "
"calendars."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je vidžet „Digitalni sat“. Kliknite na njega da prikažete kalendar. Može "
"se podesiti i da prikazuje druge vremenske zone i događaje iz vaših "
"digitalnih kalendara."

#: src/qml/pages/SimpleByDefault.qml:51
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This is the “Peek at Desktop” widget. Click on it to temporarily hide all "
"open windows so you can access the desktop. Click on it again to bring them "
"back."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je vidžet „Zaviri u površ“. Kliknite na njega da privremeno sakrijete "
"sve otvorene prozore i pristupite površi. Kliknite ponovo da ih vratite."

#: src/qml/pages/Welcome.qml:21
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "Dobro došli"

#: src/qml/pages/Welcome.qml:23
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip %1 is custom text supplied by the distro"
msgid ""
"%1<nl/><nl/>This operating system is running Plasma, a free and open-source "
"desktop environment created by KDE, an international software community of "
"volunteers. It is designed to be simple by default for a smooth experience, "
"but powerful when needed to help you really get things done. We hope you "
"love it!"
msgstr ""
"%1<nl/><nl/>Na ovom operativnom sistemu radi Plasma, slobodno okruženje "
"površi otvorenog koda, koje je stvorio KDE, međunarodna softverska zajednica "
"dobrovoljaca. Osmišljena je da bude podrazumevano jednostavna, za uglađeno "
"iskustvo, ali moćna kada zatreba, da vam pomogne da zaista obavite posao. "
"Nadamo se da ćete je zavoleti!"

#: src/qml/pages/Welcome.qml:24
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip %1 is the name of the user's distro"
msgid ""
"Welcome to the %1 operating system running KDE Plasma!<nl/><nl/>Plasma is a "
"free and open-source desktop environment created by KDE, an international "
"software community of volunteers. It is designed to be simple by default for "
"a smooth experience, but powerful when needed to help you really get things "
"done. We hope you love it!"
msgstr ""
"Dobro došli u operativni sistem %1 sa KDE Plasmom!<nl/><nl/>Plasma je "
"slobodno okruženje površi otvorenog koda, koje je stvorio KDE, međunarodna "
"softverska zajednica dobrovoljaca. Osmišljena je da bude podrazumevano "
"jednostavna, za uglađeno iskustvo, ali moćna kada zatreba, da vam pomogne da "
"zaista obavite posao. Nadamo se da ćete je zavoleti!"

